#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:1
#: 3930b54bfe074720bc92dbf72c8cd2c2
msgid "检查净力（Check Net Force）"
msgstr "Check Net Force"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:3
#: c4dca606a19f4d5891c6bb7a18b4fcae
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:5
#: acc4fe4c52db416d92a7c62117d6ed0a
msgid "计算每个结构所有原子力的矢量和 `|ΣF|`，并选中超过阈值的结构。它常用于发现未满足平移不变性、 标签映射错误或 DFT 输出异常的数据。"
msgstr "Compute the vector sum `|ΣF|` of all atomic forces in each structure and select structures above a threshold. This often reveals broken translational invariance, incorrect label mapping, or anomalous DFT output."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:8
#: 91ab1f55ada842fba52891f5f6d9a90f
msgid "判定原理"
msgstr "Decision principle"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:10
#: 68cccb6971a44814b6a5876c83c72867
msgid "对含 $N$ 个原子的结构，程序先求参考力的矢量和，再取欧氏模："
msgstr "For a structure with $N$ atoms, the program sums the reference-force vectors and then takes the Euclidean norm:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:12
#: 6211c8c40768453c89b53459e18b9f17
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf F_{\\mathrm{net}}=\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\mathbf F_i,\\qquad\n"
"F_{\\mathrm{net}}=\\left\\|\\mathbf F_{\\mathrm{net}}\\right\\|_2\n"
"=\\sqrt{F_x^2+F_y^2+F_z^2}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf F_{\\mathrm{net}}=\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\mathbf F_i,\\qquad\n"
"F_{\\mathrm{net}}=\\left\\|\\mathbf F_{\\mathrm{net}}\\right\\|_2\n"
"=\\sqrt{F_x^2+F_y^2+F_z^2}.\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:18
#: d52917e5c4ee4b0fb924345b8e02e2ac
msgid ""
"当 $F_{\\mathrm{net}}>F_{\\mathrm{threshold}}$ 时选中该结构。力的单位为 eV/Å，所以净力和阈值 "
"也都是 eV/Å。理想的孤立周期体系满足平移不变性时净力应接近零，但有限 SCF 精度、 "
"约束计算或外场也可能带来真实残差；这个工具是质量复核门槛，不是自动纠错器。"
msgstr "Select the structure when $F_{\\mathrm{net}}>F_{\\mathrm{threshold}}$. Force, net force, and the threshold are all in eV/Å. An ideal isolated periodic system satisfying translational invariance should have nearly zero net force, but finite SCF precision, constraints, or external fields can produce real residuals. This tool is a review gate, not an automatic correction."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:22
#: 1d9a55232b9f49509019bf6e9d0f23fc
msgid "参数与执行结果"
msgstr "Parameters and execution result"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:7334
#: 15ed729fa45f43df8ded0e879ee2a12a
msgid "输入控件：`净力阈值`，即 `|ΣF|`。"
msgstr "Control: `Net-force threshold`, i.e. `|ΣF|`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:7335
#: 4adf51722ded48d1b1c6484a33de54b3
msgid "范围：`[0, 1e6]`，10 位小数。"
msgstr "Range: `[0, 1e6]`, with ten decimal places."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:7336
#: 8e32e02d7fa2408e9ec91af12fca286b
msgid "默认值：`widget.force_balance_threshold`（缺省 `1e-3`）。"
msgstr "Default: `widget.force_balance_threshold` (fallback `1e-3`)."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:7337
#: 45b8bb1412d64fcca49033d07685d245
msgid "执行结果：选中超阈值结构，并显示统计消息。"
msgstr "Result: select structures above the threshold and show a summary message."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:7339
