msgid "操作后检查"
msgstr "Post-operation checks"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-net-force.md:31
#: ea25ec1c530c43999adadf04ca2c166e
msgid "阈值单位为 `eV/Å`，必须大于零。选中后结合结构原子数、计算精度和标签来源判断； 工具只标出超阈值结构，不会修改力标签。"
msgstr "The threshold is in `eV/Å` and must be positive. Interpret selected structures in light of atom count, calculation precision, and label provenance. The tool only flags structures above the threshold; it does not modify force labels."
